{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17094","headline":"和武相公中秋锦楼翫月得苍字 · 张正一","name":"和武相公中秋锦楼翫月得苍字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高秋今夜月，皓色正苍苍。\n远水澄如练，孤鸿逈带霜。\n旅人方积思，繁宿稍沈光。\n朱槛叨陪赏，尤宜清漏长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张正一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17094.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17094","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}